{"id":"b952d88439f7be8f","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-pi1-set.md","title":"Pi-1 Set","display":"df-pi1-set — Pi-1 Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-pi1-set","aliases":["88-df-pi1-set"],"display":"df-pi1-set — Pi-1 Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-pi1-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-pi1-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi1-set — Pi-1 Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ca66c29e821563a\" href=\"?note=5ca66c29e821563a\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi\">88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\">\\(\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\\)</span> (finite-tuple coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Pi_1^0\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\exists R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\mathrm{enc}(n,m):(n,m)\\in R\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;((n,m)\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nA\\in\\Pi_1^0\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\n\\land\\exists R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\\{\\mathrm{enc}(n,m):(n,m)\\in R\\}\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;((n,m)\\in R)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span>集合有全称量词定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span>集合是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span>集合的补集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span>集合可能是不可判定的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi","status":"resolved","id":"5ca66c29e821563a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":